<title>UK: Merck adds 100 mln Swiss francs to six-year bond.</title>
<headline>Merck adds 100 mln Swiss francs to six-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merck has added 100 million Swiss francs, priced at 101.35, to its 3.50 percent bond due November 2002, lead manager UBS said.  </p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> BORROWER   MERCK</p>
<p> AMT   *100 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.50	MATURITY    29.NOV.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.35    PAY DATE    29.NOV.96</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 5	   LISTING    EBS	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SWISS     HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> NOTES     *ADD-ON TO 200 MLN SFR DEAL LAUNCHED 09.OCT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
